senses.gloss:
कुठेर (क)
(1) OCIMUM BASILICUM LINN. (Avk; Bpn, p. 511-512);
[]
(2) O. SANCTUM LINN. (KB 3, p. 1967; MW?);
(3) O. GRATISSIMUM LINN. (MW?);
(4) O. CANUM SIMS (KB 3, p. 1961);
(5) a) CEDRELA TOONA ROXB. EX ROTTL. (MW);
b) = नन्दीवृक्ष (PW; Vśs); PW: the white variety of तुलसी;
Vśs: the white variety of क्षुद्रतुलसी (see तुलसी).
Ḍa. on Su.Sū. 38, 18: अर्जक is called श्वेतकुठेरक when it has
minute leaves and is odourless; Ḍa. on Su.Sū. 46, 221: कुठेरक is a
variety of बर्बरिका; Aruṇa on A.h.Sū. 6, 106: = वैकुण्ठक; He
on A. h.Sū. 6, 106: = कालमाला; Dn, वर्ग 4, 54: = अर्जक = वै-
कुण्ठ; Rn, वर्ग 10, 84-85: = अर्जक = क्षुद्रतुलसी (see तुलसी).
